<body>
  <header class="site-header"><div class="shell"><nav class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="m4 17 5-10 3 6 2-4 6 8"/><path d="M3 20h18"/></svg></span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>Nordvale</strong><span>Wild Park & Forest Reserve</span></span></a><div class="main-nav"><a href="/experiente">Experiențe</a><a href="/planifica">Planifică vizita</a><a href="/calendar">Calendar</a><a href="/grupuri">Grupuri</a></div><div class="nav-actions"><a class="ticket-cta" href="/bilete">Bilete</a><button class="menu-btn" id="menuOpen" type="button" aria-label="Deschide meniul"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg></button></div></nav></div></header>

  <main class="shell"><section class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar"><div class="profile-mini"><span class="avatar">AP</span><span><strong>Andrei Popescu</strong><span>Wild Circle member</span></span></div><nav class="side-nav"><a href="/cont"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 4h6v6H4zM14 4h6v6h-6zM4 14h6v6H4zM14 14h6v6h-6z"/></svg>Dashboard</a><a href="/cont/bilete"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 7h16v4a2 2 0 0 0 0 4v4H4v-4a2 2 0 0 0 0-4z"/></svg>Biletele mele</a><a href="/cont/comenzi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M5 4h14v16H5z"/></svg>Comenzi</a><a href="/cont/abonamente"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 6h16v12H4z"/><path d="M8 10h8"/></svg>Abonamente</a><a class="active" href="#"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/></svg>Profil și date</a><a href="#preferences"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 6h16M7 12h10M9 18h6"/></svg>Preferințe</a></nav><div class="side-help"><strong>Ai nevoie de ajutor?</strong><p>Echipa noastră poate actualiza datele unei rezervări sau ale beneficiarilor.</p><a href="#">Deschide suportul →</a></div></aside>

    <section class="content">
